WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.876
- Okay, ready guys, audition him.

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:03.545
- It's a lot of pressure here.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:05.213
(laughter)

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:06.214
- My name is Nick Barili

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:07.924
and I'm traveling the country to sit down

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:09.551
with some of the biggest Latinx artists

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:10.927
in places that have meaning to them,

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.178
and help tell their stories.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.097
It brings a sense of emotion

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.474
because you're standing
there looking at kids

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:20.020
and go my God, these kids
are so communicative.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.063
and they all have their stories.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.316
There was nothing natural
about me playing baseball.

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:26.234
There was nothing natural

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.777
about me being a rock and roll singer,

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:30.488
there was nothing natural
about me being an actor.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:34.117
Natural is just years and
year and years of hard work,

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.827
make you a natural.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:38.121
- You've been a strong
advocate for representation

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.247
for a long time.

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:41.249
- Trying to understand your culture

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:44.711
and the roots that make
you the tree that you are,

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.337
and the human being that you are,

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:48.048
makes everybody stronger.

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.425
success is having lived your life

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.510
doing what you really want it to do.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.555
The strongest advice I can 
give is don’t stop.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.432
Just don't stop.

